# Learning

## Project manifest

Read **`.arlox/project.json`** at the workspace root for npm package naming and stack conventions.

## After adding a feature

1. Pass `npm run build`.
2. Consume API contracts from **`contracts/<feature>.md`** (workspace root).
3. Run **`.cursor/skills/learn/SKILL.md`** (mandatory) and append to **`learned/README.md`**.

## Gated learning

- Modifying core files (`src/api/`, `src/stores/`, `src/app/`, `src/layouts/`) requires checking `learned/README.md` first.
- UI work requires **`web/.arlox/design-system.json`** and `design-system.mdc`.

## Learned index

`.cursor/skills/add-feature-web/learned/README.md` is the index.

Mark promoted patterns with `**Applied:** YYYY-MM-DD — <what changed>`.  
Check pending entries with `arlox skills status`.
